WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.230
Start the masking process on the side and hurry!

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:08.360
Don't let the mass media speculate anything weird!

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.530
Remove all of the objects completely!

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.370
We picked up something big this time.

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.530
Is here all right?

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.330
Yes.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.700
Thank you for assisting us all the way from Earth.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.370
Say hello to Chief Nina for me.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.080
Thank you for your assistance.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:31.130
That colony...

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.050
That thing... It was from the past.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:41.470
Sign: Paranormal department and co. we have what you forgot

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:42.310
That is...

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:45.390
Itsuki-kun, welcome back. I was worried.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.980
Nina, whose doing is this?

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:49.940
This...

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.830
Don't mind it, don't mind it.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.610
Can you take it to the hangar while you're at it?

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.490
Is it all right to do that?

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:00.540
It's okay. Anyway, hurry up and come down and let me see your face.

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:09.630
Shishidou!

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.210
Shishidou?

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:13.760
Huh?

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:28.630
Flying through space, freely, gracefully

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:32.330
On the shoulders and in the heart, the girl has wings

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:36.020
The world she was born into is beautiful

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:39.670
Even a goddess cannot rule

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:47.080
That dream on a star born in darkness,

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.980
it won't shine by just watching.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:54.440
My body becomes a spaceship,

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.700
and climbs to the atmosphere of my thoughts

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:12.460
If I try to resign to calmness, my heart will bug up.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:16.180
Hey, with your rocket,

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:19.620
can you change my path?

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:23.550
By being connected together, we confirm

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:29.090
we aren't androids

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:33.040
Across the rainbow, to the future to someone

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:36.760
If wishing will get me there, I will gradually start believing

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:40.420
The world we march into is limitless

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:44.090
Even God cannot destroy it all

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:49.230
And one day even the sins people made will disappear

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.620
So that's how it is.

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:24.540
No wonder he's interested in you.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:29.100
You don't have a dream nor anything you want to do.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:32.020
Nothing at all. Such a pitiful child.

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:34.480
You're pretty straightforward, aren't you.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.010
Who are you?

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:39.350
That's why you're able to run faster than anyone else.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.790
Without any aims, you remain stagnant.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:48.100
The power in you is overflowing and you can face anything no matter what.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:49.610
Isn't that right?

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.190
Umm... What are you talking about?

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:55.690
I'm looking forward to it.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:57.820
It's making me excited.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.160
The girl who leapt through space.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.990
That again?

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:09.330
The Messenger From Another Realm

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.720
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.900
Huh? This is my room-

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.760
Ojou-sama!

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.010
Ojou-sama!

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.730
Thank god...

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.260
It's because I'm not good enough...

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.670
That's not true.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.380
I'm also glad that you're fine, Imo-chan.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.600
Ojou-sama...

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.320
We were brought back by Julio-sama...

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.830
...while we were floating in space.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:32.620
Space?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.080
Yes.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.270
What happened to that thing?! That strange thing.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:44.340
The news said that it exploded but...

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.500
Exploded?

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.000
Yes, because of the missiles from Earth.

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.290
Is it possible to destroy such a thing?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.360
I see. So you're all right.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.140
Nami.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:57.010
They said that you were missing and I was looking forward to that a little.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.910
Those words again.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.430
It doesn't matter anyway.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:04.760
Causing this kind of ruckus, even under normal circumstances, the Shishidou family won't...

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.430
Return to your room, Nami.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:10.270
Are you all right, Akiha?

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.480
Y-Yeah...

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.270
Why were you so reckless?

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.980
If you don't want to get married then just say so.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:17.820
Eh?

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.820
What are you saying?!

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.240
Then for whose sake did I...

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:22.820
I'm sorry too, Nami.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.140
My words were a little aggressive before.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:29.830
But I was only thinking of your happiness, Akiha.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:34.340
I-Is that so... I'm sorry too.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:37.630
I never thought that Onee-chan saw it that way.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.920
It's okay. There's still a lot of time.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:40.550
Time?

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:44.610
The other party is willing to wait until you agree to the marriage.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.850
Let me know when you have decided to.

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:49.220
Ah, umm...

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.910
That's not what I meant...

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.660
She doesn't understand at all.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.980
Really? I think she was pretty worried about you.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:05:59.940
That's right!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:03.320
Keep. Your groom is being kept.

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:05.910
No one asked them to do that.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.870
Besides, the other party...

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:14.390
Is Shishidou Akiha around?

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:16.730
Umm... that's me.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:20.550
The student council president would like to have a word with you.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.650
Can you spare a bit of your time?

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:27.930
What did you do, senpai? Being called by the Student Council.

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:29.740
I have no idea.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.610
Is this your first time on the level free floor?

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:37.330
Yes.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:44.000
All your sisters and relatives in the Shishidou family graduated from level free.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:47.120
Akiha-san, you are also welcomed to come here to visit.

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.620
It's an honor.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:53.040
It's impossible. My grades aren't good enough.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.540
Come in.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:10.280
President, I've brought Shishidou Akiha.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:11.390
Okay.

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:17.860
So you're the third child in the Shishidou family.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:19.520
What's this?

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.230
Please stop that.

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.580
What do you want to talk about?

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:26.910
As expected from a Shishidou family member. Always on guard.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:27.340
Hey!

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.620
That's an image from the surveillance camera.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:40.670
It's hard to escape from punishment if you use the emergency capsule without authorization.

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:41.500
That's...

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.670
What did you do with it?

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:46.470
I'm asking you what you did!

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:00.730
Stop her.

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:06.700
Run.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:07.150
You're...!

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:07.650
Hurry!

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:08.130
Yes!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:15.450
What's happening?! What's with that kid?!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.140
What do you mean?!

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:22.540
What did we tell you earlier? Good job.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:26.670
Section chief Nina and investigator Kannagi are to go back to their daily duties.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:30.090
This incident should be handled by our paranormal department.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:32.720
And for that, I started an investigation...

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:36.230
You're just trying to take all the credit. Don't call it an investigation!

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:41.910
Well, it's understandable that even a small paranormal investigator would like to be acknowledged.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:46.900
The object which violated the law has been destroyed by the missiles from Earth.

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.110
End of investigation.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:51.200
Or do you have something else to say? Did a monster appear?

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.030
That would surely be your responsibility.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:57.960
We can't explain it to the public that way.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:05.340
What kind of missiles are able to destroy something that big without leaving a trace?!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:08.880
There might be terrorists using the colony as a base.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:10.050
How can you so easily...!

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:17.930
Nina Stratoski and Kannagi Itsuki will return to daily duties together.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.020
Nina! I can't accept it!

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:26.960
Itsuki-kun.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.360
Let's just leave this kind of useless argument be.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:31.030
But...

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:34.200
Let's meet at Janis at 7:30.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.620
The paranormal department is not something temporary.

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:42.330
Senpai. Senpai!

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.980
Senpai! Akiha-senpai!

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.470
Alright, we will start homeroom.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.340
Today, our class will have...

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:58.850
Kawai Honoka.

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.700
Y-Y-You...

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:39.720
Itsuki-kun!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.450
Over here.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.060
Good job.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:46.480
Well, many things have happened, but it's okay as long you're fine.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:49.190
Nina, about today...

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:51.330
Don't be so hasty, Crispy.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.860
Looks like a lot has happened while I was away.

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.300
Ul, you're back!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.870
Looks like you're troubled.

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:02.410
There's no doubt about it.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:06.380
What you've encountered is a brain colony. A special object.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:08.920
What's a brain colony?

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:11.050
Nina, didn't you tell her?

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:14.720
The higher-ups seem to be acting very suspicious for some reason.

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.390
That's how they cover things up.

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:22.560
Why would an artificial intelligence, banned fifty years ago, suddenly appear now?

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:25.100
Now that you know, it makes sense they'd cover it up.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:26.140
How can that be...

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:29.160
We should handle it the way you suggested before.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:33.580
What is the ICP doing? What are they hiding?

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.820
This is indeed an abnormal sight.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.280
Then...

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.590
That's how it is.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.990
I'm here to investigate this matter.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.080
Well, at least put your bag down.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:45.410
Hey. Give me milk.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:51.660
Huh? Milk? Miss, what kind of place do you think this is-

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.430
Hey, drunkard. Watch what you're saying.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:00.600
I'm itching to test out this fella's power.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.850
See you tomorrow.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:05.730
Bye bye.

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:06.600
Goodbye.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:10.020
Ojou-sama, Ojou-sama.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.770
Huh? Why is she over there?

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:21.870
It's pretty exciting, isn't it?

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:24.450
It must be Shishidou over thinking things again.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:26.870
That's not true. It's because I've seen it.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:28.790
Where? What did you see?

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.370
Even if I tell you, you still won't understand.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:40.510
Huh?

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:45.720
Julio! Neneko-chan!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:53.440
Come with me, the girl who leapt through space.

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:55.230
That again?

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:03.780
Ojou-sama. Ojou-sama.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.660
Found...

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.010
Ojou-sama!

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:13.040
Akiha Ojou-sama!

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:27.220
The speed is currently at 45.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.220
Where am I?

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:35.710
The girl who leapt through space.

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.950
Where are Julio and Neneko-chan?!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.320
I left them there.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:43.370
You...

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:48.290
Thank you everyone for riding today.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:49.120
Imo-chan.

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:52.710
We are entering the high speed way now.

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.230
Everyone, there will be shaking so be careful.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.340
Next is the final station.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.730
Leopard ahead.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.640
Leopard ahead.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:20.030
Why do you always appear during my tea time?

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:22.900
I don't know. And what do you want?

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.700
What a noisy person.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:27.490
One who can't adjust will never be successful in society.

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:29.720
Anyway, didn't you explode?

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.710
Me? Explode?

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:35.080
Who in this world is capable of doing that?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.350
That must be some mass media misconception.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:41.090
That kind of conversation doesn't matter.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:43.550
And before that, what are you?

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:48.930
You humans too. Do you know what you are?

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.100
Huh?

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.560
U-Umm...

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:53.730
3, 2, 1, boo!

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:55.730
I said it!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:59.360
That's what you deserve! Saying this line to humans is a hundred percent hit!

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:01.030
Foolish humans.

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:02.630
It was a good line.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.070
You...!

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.410
Leopard is the king.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:07.320
What?

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:08.740
An incomplete king.

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.930
It will be over if he falls into the enemy's hands.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.040
And you are the queen.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.790
What do you mean?

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:22.170
Ojou-sama!

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:27.110
What queen?

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:44.740
The big guy you met is much worse than I had anticipated.

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:46.410
Look.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:49.280
This structure, right?

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.490
There's no doubt about it.

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:54.680
A second class special object. An antimatter cannon.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.670
An antimatter cannon...

00:15:56.670 --> 00:16:00.180
Yeah. It can blow away half a moon.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:04.970
It most likely turned it into a dud because the magnetic chamber was damaged.

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:05.940
So it's spoiled.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.130
This might be our chance.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.390
Our chance?

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:10.360
Don't you understand?

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:15.680
If we know that this object is a brain colony, we know what kind of things it needs to do a self-repair.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:17.940
We have to find that part.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:20.060
The magnetic chamber!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:24.730
If we search the traffic administrative database for records of confiscated illegal materials...

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:27.820
Bingo!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.420
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.090
This place is...

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:47.630
Ojou-sama.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.300
Eh? Imo-chan...

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:50.440
...and Honoka-chan.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.300
Golden orb.

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:54.260
Goru gondon debu?

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:55.770
Golden orb.

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:56.890
The magnetic chamber.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.480
Leopard needs that.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:00.700
Needs it?

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.900
Explain it to me properly!

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.800
W-Wait...

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:15.430
We're going to equip the Q-Tector.

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.450
Q-what?

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.380
Wow...

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:34.820
You're next, Akiha.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.810
Eh? Me too?

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:40.940
Ojou-sama...

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.270
T-This is a bit...

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:43.310
Hurry up.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.860
Wait a minute. Wait!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:56.410
You look cool, Ojou-sama!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:57.300
Changed!

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.370
We're going to get the golden orb.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.040
Where to?

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:16.610
Launching.

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:27.730
The Q-Tector enables the QT-Arms to receive transmissions directly from you.

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.820
That means I've become like Imo-chan?

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:34.990
The QT-Arms move according to how we imagine them to, right?

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.120
This is probably a slot.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:38.490
You want to try going in, Imo-chan?

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:42.100
Umm, I'm a little afraid of these kind of machines.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.790
It's Branpu's good friend.

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:01.430
Hey, is it all right to open it like that?

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:03.770
Wouldn't getting the port's permission be a better idea?

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:05.150
They wouldn't permit it.

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:06.730
We're here to take the golden orb.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:09.080
Wait a minute. Isn't that stealing?

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.030
Leopard needs it.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:12.380
We don't have to be selective in choosing how to do things.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.960
That's the security droid camera.

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:30.800
If it's destroyed, the ICP would be alerted.

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:32.190
Isn't this a crime?!

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:35.020
To all patrols nearby!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:38.680
There's an intruder in Kirkwood mining area 4 plant number 7.

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:40.200
Please head to the scene immediately.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.720
Looks like we're the first.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:42.970
Let's go, Nina.

00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:45.480
Don't be too reckless, both of you.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.200
Okay. Nina, off we go.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:58.530
This plant has been abandoned for fifteen years already.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:19:59.490
Any reactions?

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:01.800
The speed sensor is a little chaotic.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:03.750
Be careful.

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.580
There hasn't been much time between now and when the intruders arrived.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.270
There's something over there.

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:16.300
QT-Arms at 12 o'clock!

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:22.140
The QT-Arms over there, please stop attacking.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.900
Please stop attacking.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:30.080
Or else...

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.910
Is that the same one you met before?

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.680
No, the color is different.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:59.300
I got caught up in things...

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:05.270
According to the data that Honoka-san gave us, there's a search panel down below but...

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.930
What should we do?

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.700
Oh, well. It doesn't seem like anyone is around anyway.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.950
Is this the golden orb?

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.160
It seems like it.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.730
Looks like there's a control to switch it on nearby.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:36.550
I've reached it.

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.090
Umm...

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:43.050
It's open, Imo-chan.

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:45.100
Hey!

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:46.850
Stop right there!

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:01.130
Who are you?

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:04.370
Bring me to that colony.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:07.620
Huh?

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:19.310
This is...

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:20.800
What?!

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:22.440
Nerval.

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:44.210
My heart is on a trip,

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:50.160
Blooming at the number of stars that no one has seen

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:55.940
With unstoppable curiosity,

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:58.460
I want to go with you,

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:01.550
in a shuttle flying through the past and future

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:06.690
Advancing forward, don't stop us.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:12.900
Trying to change tomorrow is fine, right?

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:18.430
Go on, with the excited feeling

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:24.890
you found from the answer found when you were lost.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:30.830
Jump from Earth! Encounters are the galaxies' crossroads

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:36.700
Isn't coincidence's prank pleasant?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:39.500
Suddenly jumping boundlessly

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:42.390
Friends of space

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:48.110
Journeys do become a habit, don't they?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:53.740
Journeys and girls are the same...

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:55.770
Ya know!

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:15.030
The Golden Soul Shouts

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.690
The name "paranormal department" is too short.

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:05.820
We should call it the "Inter-Colony Police Special Paranormal Department..."

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:07.530
Itsuki-kun, please repeat it again.

00:24:07.530 --> 00:24:09.820
The Inter-Colony Police...

00:24:08.660 --> 00:24:09.820
Repeat it again.

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:10.780
Inter...

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:12.830
Just "paranormal department," okay?

00:24:12.830 --> 00:24:15.030
Okay.
